```json
{
  "Version": "2012-10-17",
  "Statement": [{
    "Sid": "ReadTenantDocs",
    "Effect": "Allow",
    "Action": ["s3:GetObject"],
    "Resource": "arn:aws:s3:::acme-docs/tenants/t-42/*",
    "Condition": {
      "StringEquals": { "aws:PrincipalTag/team": "payments" },
      "Bool": { "aws:SecureTransport": "true" }
    }
  }]
}
```
**Principal** (who — only in resource/trust policies), **Action**, **Resource**, **Condition**, **Effect**.
